\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Blockchain-Based Decentralized Auditing for AI Decisions. The diagram shows a future-direction concept which connects MEAIF system outputs to blockchain audit trail functionality. The system stores essential model data and decision logs and fairness metrics through an unalterable ledger system which organizes them as consecutive blocks (Block n, n+1, n+2 contain model information and decisions and metrics respectively). The blockchain records are accessible to auditing nodes (validators/regulators) for transparent verification (audit access) to ensure tamper-proof accountability in AI decision-making. The proposed decentralized audit system achieves the recommended goals of establishing immediate oversight and trust in AI systems.}}{8}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:blockchain}{{5}{8}{Blockchain-Based Decentralized Auditing for AI Decisions. The diagram shows a future-direction concept which connects MEAIF system outputs to blockchain audit trail functionality. The system stores essential model data and decision logs and fairness metrics through an unalterable ledger system which organizes them as consecutive blocks (Block n, n+1, n+2 contain model information and decisions and metrics respectively). The blockchain records are accessible to auditing nodes (validators/regulators) for transparent verification (audit access) to ensure tamper-proof accountability in AI decision-making. The proposed decentralized audit system achieves the recommended goals of establishing immediate oversight and trust in AI systems}{figure.5}{}}
